host.innerHTML=`<summary><strong>Latest research · scoped fixes and targeted follow-ups · 0.79</strong></summary><p><strong>Live student flow and matcher unchanged.</strong> Before: final 0.78 research replay. After: seven exact question-scope repairs and up to four short probes. Missing interests remain unknown. Bachelor/graduate uses college or graduate routes; associate/specialist programs remain separate.</p><div class="repair-controls"><label>Cohort <select id="r79-cohort">${Object.entries(labels).map(([id,name])=>`<option value="${id}">${name}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Education <select id="r79-education"><option value="all">Every education level</option><option value="degree">Bachelor or graduate</option><option value="college">Bachelor route</option><option value="graduate">Graduate route</option><option value="program">Associate / specialist program</option><option value="work">Work / short training</option><option value="apprenticeship">Apprenticeship</option></select></label><label>Cases <select id="r79-filter"><option value="all">All models</option><option value="changed">Changed Top list</option><option value="missing">No supported Top</option><option value="degree">No bachelor/graduate Top</option><option value="below">Supported degree below Top-three</option><option value="withdrawn">Supported career withdrawn</option><option value="unknown">Targeted probe still unknown</option><option value="conflict">Broad-interest disagreement in Top</option></select></label><label>Find model <input id="r79-search" type="search" placeholder="Name or model ID"></label></div><div id="r79-overview"></div><details><summary>Original holdout splits · shown separately</summary><div id="r79-holdouts"></div></details><div id="r79-probes"></div><details><summary>Retained first pass · responsibility-scope correction</summary><div id="r79-first-pass"></div><p>The first pass treated course assessment as educator-coaching interest for some instructional-coordinator offers. The corrected run leaves that distinct responsibility unknown unless explicitly established.</p><a href="./simulator-repair-079-first-pass.json.gz">Retained first-pass paired data · gzip</a></details><p>Both cohorts have previously informed review, including Grok examples. These are further calibration diagnostics, not unseen validation. Short probes reuse frozen profile evidence and do not establish new unstated interests. Earnings are unchanged qualified-entry planning proxies, not measured starting salaries.</p><label>Distribution <select id="r79-dimension"><option value="career">Career</option><option value="field">Field</option></select></label> <label>Category <select id="r79-category"><option value="top">Supported Top</option><option value="supported">All supported options</option><option value="candidates">Unconfirmed exploration candidates</option></select></label><div id="r79-distribution"></div><p><button id="r79-csv">Download filtered models · CSV</button> · <a href="./simulator-repair-079.json.gz">Paired research data · gzip</a> · <a href="./simulator-repair-078.json.gz">Required unchanged baseline · gzip</a></p><p id="r79-count"></p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Model & frozen evidence</th><th>Before · supported Top</th><th>After · supported Top</th><th>Supported alternatives, candidates & follow-ups</th></tr></thead><tbody id="r79-rows"></tbody></table></div><div><button id="r79-prev">Previous</button> <span id="r79-page"></span> <button id="r79-next">Next</button></div>`;
